The comic strip depicts a rabbit sitting at a desk with a computer. In the first panel, he is calmly using it. In the second, he reacts with shock as something (a banana peel) flies out of the monitor. The third panel shows him in a state of panic as the monitor erupts in a flood of garbage, and by the end, the room is completely covered in trash.

